From a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bare Browser <noreply@localhost>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 70/71] Add Safe Shield anti-porn family filter and SafeSearch

Introduces Safe Shield, an on-device content filter and family protection engine:

- NavigationThrottle domain interceptor: blocks pornographic, adult, and explicit
  domains before connection initiation, serving an on-device interstitial.
- Multi-layer DNS enforcement: automatically configures and locks DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH)
  to Cloudflare Family (1.1.1.3) or CleanBrowsing Family Filter endpoints.
- Enforced SafeSearch: automatically rewrites queries on Google (safe=active), Bing
  (adlt=strict), DuckDuckGo (kp=1) and YouTube (Restricted Mode) to prevent explicit
  results.
- Comprehensive Settings panel: independent toggles for Adult Content, SafeSearch,
  Family DoH, customizable Whitelist exceptions, and a local Blocked Attempts Log.
- Visual Shield vector icon and fully customizable block page.
